# Repo workflow

- Chart work: branch `feat/$chartname-$target_version` (e.g. `feat/common-26.9`). Repo/CI/docs: `chore/…`.
- PRs into `main` only; **squash-merge**. No incomplete charts on `main`.
- Directory `charts/<name>/` must match `Chart.yaml` `name`.
- Commit `Chart.lock`; never commit vendored `charts/*/charts/*.tgz` (gitignored).
- Never commit scratch/audit files (`AUDIT.md`, local notes). Delete them before PR.
- Prefer `CONTRIBUTING.md` for the full checklist; follow Chart.yaml Cursor rules when editing charts.
- Every application chart needs `logos/<chart>.png` and an `icon` URL on `retsamedoc.github.io/helm-charts/logos/`. Do not use an upstream icon URL.
